			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.12.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; <i>instinctively,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. φεύγομεν τὴν ἀλγηδόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
